cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software or protocol, please cite the companion article
  (preferred) and, optionally, this software repository.
type: software
title: >-
  Bounding graph-mediated leakage in knowledge tracing (companion code)
abstract: >-
  Companion code for a train-only audit protocol and leakage exposure bound
  for graph-enhanced knowledge tracing. The repository provides fold-aware
  graph construction, DAG audit, leakage diagnostics, cold-start
  stratification, DDR probes, controlled leak injection, exposure-bound
  tables, and paper artefact generation. It is not a new SOTA KT backbone.
